            </contributor>
            <history xml:id="history_id9938bf1a">
               <p xml:id="idm152">Rosing's song was published anonymously in "Nogle Smaadigte af en Student" (Some Small Poems by A Student) in 1859. Hartmann sat music to four other poems from this collection: "Solnedgang" (HartW 397), "Et Ønske" (HartW 401), "Vaarsang" (HartW 405), and "Klage" (HartW 407).</p>
            </history>
