               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_N202CD">2 bifolios containing "Klage" (HartW 407) (not in the printed edition); No. 1 "Vaarsang"; and No. 3 "Et Ønske" (HartW 401) all in fair copy and sketches. Written in brown ink. Paper: 14 staves. After the last bar of "Klage" on p. 1, stave 7: ("Nogle Smaadigte af en Student" pag 71.); beneath the last bar of "Vaarsang" on p. 2, between staves 6 and 7: "af samme pag. 50." Beneath the last bar of "Et Ønske" on p. 3, between staves 6 and 7: "af samme pag 52". "Vaarsang" notated on two staves with the text above the upper stave.</physMedium>
